    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch12-38: not-empirically-resolvable, resolvability 0.35";
    dc:description "Public mathematical corpora can document selection patterns but cannot resolve the claimed causal explanation or whether present mathematics is uncharacteristic of all possibilities. The central comparison lacks a measurable reference population.";
