    dc:type "resolution-route/none";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Historical and bibliometric studies could compare researched topics with known decidability and tractability, but cannot observe the counterfactual universe of possible mathematics or isolate methodological self-selection as the cause.";
